{"title": "Heat Metal (Condition)", "pageid": 9459, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Heat_Metal_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has tick type", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Heat_Metal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Metal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Heat_Metal_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Heat_Metal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Heat_Metal_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Heat_Metal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat Metal Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Heat_Metal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Metal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Heat_Metal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Heat Metal</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Heats up a metal weapon or armour on a creature with no save (weapon is automatically prioritized).</li>\n<li>Metal weapons are dropped if the creature holding it fails their initial <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>.</li>\n<li>If the creature is touching the heated metal item, they receive <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a>.</li>\n<li>Each subsequent turn, if the creature is still touching the metal, the spellcaster can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reapply_Heat_Metal\" title=\"Reapply Heat Metal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reapply Heat Metal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reapply_Heat_Metal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reapply Heat Metal\">Reapply Heat Metal</a> to deal another <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage, forcing the creature to pass a Saving Throw again or drop the item (if it is a metal weapon). </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: start of turn\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/TickingWithSource\" title=\"Status properties/TickingWithSource\">TickingWithSource</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/RemoveOnLongRest\" title=\"Status properties/RemoveOnLongRest\">RemoveOnLongRest</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Heat_Metal\">Sources of Heat Metal</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Metal\" title=\"Heat Metal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/45px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/60px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat Metal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Metal\" title=\"Heat Metal\">Heat Metal</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rolan%27s_Fireball\" title=\"Rolan's Fireball\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/30px-Fireball_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/45px-Fireball_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/60px-Fireball_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rolan's Fireball\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/30px-Fireball_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Rolan%27s_Fireball\" title=\"Rolan's Fireball\">Rolan's Fireball</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCa